 line approximation of $f(x) = \\sin x$ at $x = \\frac{3π}{4}$.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question." :question/requires-calculator true} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186079019 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08a18831-f183-5cdd-8fcb-9548c30f5cb0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{t}\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{2}+1}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327002} {:answer/id #uuid "98c82978-387a-50bc-b120-9bf9da77c96a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "${2}^{{t}^{2}+1}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328253} {:answer/id #uuid "9ab042c2-1936-51b4-9bb9-5669b987c3e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2t\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{2}+1}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328274} {:answer/id #uuid "de792cb1-7aae-5f8b-bf85-6ccb905e6fe3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{3}}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328883} {:answer/id #uuid "eef24d4e-c366-50d7-8e61-98ee24535a7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{2}+1}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329020}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9ab042c2-1936-51b4-9bb9-5669b987c3e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2t\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{2}+1}$ million bacteria per day" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328274} :answer-field/id #uuid "6e47fc36-8219-578e-9995-521d8025f3f8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186329371}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1b4091c7-9a78-5230-a947-2f7371f4b53c" :question/math-academy-id "q-48696" :question/problem "The population $p$, in millions, of a particular colony of bacteria after $t$ days can be modeled by the function $p(t)=\\frac{{2}^{{t}^{2}+1}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}.$ What is the instantaneous rate of change of the bacteria population as a function of $t?$" :question/worked-solution "The instantaneous rate of change of the bacteria population is equal to ${p}^{′}(t).$ \n\nFirst, we take the derivative and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{p}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{{2}^{{t}^{2}+1}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{{2}^{{t}^{2}+1}\\cdot (2t)\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2} \\\\  & =2t\\cdot {2}^{{t}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186079020 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a699b6f2-ac55-5b56-9ecb-1b8c15783bb2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the $y$-coordinate of $A$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186076899} {:answer/id #uuid "e93fae38-8e08-51b0-9829-e1a24272d07f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the $y$-coordinate of $D$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186076900} {:answer/id #uuid "014c7d95-bd28-530f-9dde-914707c85932" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the $y$-coordinate of $B$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186076901} {:answer/id #uuid "043b8a0a-ca73-5196-9a5e-7256b8376211" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the $x$-coordinate of $A$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186076902} {:answer/id #uuid "236a3d16-ed00-50df-bf80-5975a2fd3233" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "the $y$-coordinate of $C$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186076903}] :answer-field/id #uuid "097a980b-abf1-51ea-99b1-97973a9c85d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :